# The origin the link-preview card is addressed to. `og:url`, `og:image` and
# `twitter:image` in index.html are %VITE_SITE_ORIGIN% + %BASE_URL% + a path,
# because a crawler will not resolve a relative one. This is the GitHub Pages
# origin, which both builds deploy.yml makes want; netlify.toml sets the
# variable to Netlify's own `URL` for the build it serves at its domain root.
# `the link preview` and `the front door` in src/guards/meta.test.ts read this
# file.
VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=https://ecao310.github.io
